{"articleNo":"742","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=742&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"체육관 개방 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.05.19","hit":"15753","attachments":[{"name":"type-word.docx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=742&attachNo=522"},{"name":"type-pdf.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=742&attachNo=523"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><!--StartFragment--></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1. 우리대학교 체육관을 학생 및 교직원의 건강 증진을 위하여 아래와 같이 개방하오니 많은 이용 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 학기중 : 09:00 ~ 22:00</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 방학중 : 09:00 ~ 18:00</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 공휴일 및 휴무일 : 개방하지 않음</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 행사 및 경기목적으로 체육관 사용 승인을 받은 경우 우선하여 사용함</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조, 한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2. 시행일 : 2009.04.20.(월)부터.&nbsp; 끝.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;-미소M&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
